      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹2.99 (up from ₹2.30 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹10.9b (up 8.2% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹615.6m (up 30% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 5.6% (up from 4.7% in 3Q 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Revenue is forecast to grow 12% p.a. on average during the next 3 years, while revenues in the Basic Materials industry in India are expected to remain flat. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 65% per year but the company’s share price has fallen by 13% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings.",
